=== FIREBASE ===
Konfiguration via firebase_options.dart (flutterfire configure)
=== ADMOB ===
Test-IDs im Code, für Produktion hier eintragen:
ADMOB_APP_ID_ANDROID=ca-app-pub-XXXXXYYYYY
ADMOB_APP_ID_IOS=ca-app-pub-XXXXXYYYYY
ADMOB_BANNER_ANDROID=ca-app-pub-XXXXX/YYYYY
ADMOB_BANNER_IOS=ca-app-pub-XXXXX/YYYYY
ADMOB_REWARDED_ANDROID=ca-app-pub-XXXXX/YYYYY
ADMOB_REWARDED_IOS=ca-app-pub-XXXXX/YYYYY
=== REVENUECAT ===
REVENUECAT_KEY_ANDROID=your_key
REVENUECAT_KEY_IOS=your_key
=== FIREBASE DYNAMIC LINKS (für iOS Referral) ===
DYNAMIC_LINK_DOMAIN=yourapp.page.link
IOS_BUNDLE_ID=com.yourcompany.yourapp
IOS_APP_STORE_ID=123456789
=== API KEYS ===
AI_API_KEY=your_gemini_or_openai_key
